                    <span class="text-3xl mr-3">🤖</span> AI Analysis Report
                </h2>

                <div class="p-2 rounded-full group-hover:bg-gray-100 transition">
                    <svg id="llm-toggle-icon" class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-500 transition-transform rotate-180" fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
                    </svg>
